skills/vercel-react-best-practices is Vercel's react-best-practices skill from
https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills (commit 063bee94, 2026-08-28). That
repository declares the MIT license in its README and in the skill's frontmatter
(license: MIT). Its files are included under that license, unchanged except three links in
AGENTS.md repointed from ./<rule>.md to rules/<rule>.md, where the files are.

