skills/grafana-dashboard/references/grafana holds files from two Grafana Labs
repositories, both under the Apache License 2.0, whose text is in
skills/grafana-dashboard/references/grafana/LICENSE:

- gcx-create-dashboard.md, gcx-manage-dashboards.md, gcx-resource-operations.md, and
  gcx-resource-model.md are claude-plugin/skills/create-dashboard/SKILL.md,
  claude-plugin/skills/manage-dashboards/SKILL.md, and that skill's
  references/resource-operations.md and references/resource-model.md from
  https://github.com/grafana/gcx (commit 41df57a4, 2026-10-22). Changes: the two links
  in gcx-manage-dashboards.md point to the renamed reference files beside it.
- dashboarding.md, dashboard-json-schema.md, promql.md, promql-patterns.md, and loki.md
  are skills/grafana-core/dashboarding/SKILL.md and references/json-schema.md,
  skills/grafana-core/promql/SKILL.md and references/patterns.md, and
  skills/grafana-lgtm/loki/SKILL.md from https://github.com/grafana/skills
  (commit cc33318b, 2026-10-16). Changes: links to references/json-schema.md and
  references/patterns.md now point to the renamed files beside them, and loki.md
  drops its closing References section, whose three links point to files that
  repository doesn't include.
